      "raw": "# Vincent   6.0  App Store screenshots\n",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Vincent   6.0  App Store screenshots"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000004",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 4,
      "end_line": 4,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 5,
      "end_line": 5,
      "raw": "`AppStore-6.0-01.png` to  `AppStore-6.0-06.png` is the final asset for App Store Connect upload. All final images are  2880×1800,  16:10, opaque  RGB  PNG.  `*-source.png` is the original captured directly from  Vincent   6.0  build.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000006",
      "kind": "blank",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 6,
      "raw": "\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "b000007",
      "kind": "table",
      "start_line": 7,
      "end_line": 14,
      "raw": "|File|Screen|5.1  highlight after|\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `AppStore-6.0-01.png` |Main editor|Organized toolbar, presentation and profile entry points|\n| `AppStore-6.0-02.png` |New canvas|`Infinite canvas`  creation options|\n| `AppStore-6.0-03.png` |General settings|Start canvas, surrounding  Vincent  navigation, purchase restore and update verification|\n| `AppStore-6.0-04.png` |Profile settings|Profile image·name, user invite allowed|\n| `AppStore-6.0-05.png` |Members settings|LAN  canvas sharing and host member status|\n| `AppStore-6.0-06.png` |Presentation mode|Full-screen artwork display and laser pointer trajectory|\n",
